# SOUNDINGS: a blow is the item's power times (50 + 10 a level) %,
# half again on a weak spot (REEF beats ZAP beats OOZE beats REEF), then
# 90-110 %. Shields' shares come off what is left.
game soundings
wait 30
cheat calc_atk 200 1 1 1 100
expect calc == 180
cheat calc_atk 200 1 1 2 100
expect calc == 120
cheat calc_atk 200 1 0 1 100
expect calc == 120
cheat calc_atk 400 16 3 3 100
expect calc == 1260
cheat calc_atk 300 8 2 2 110
expect calc == 643
cheat calc_reduce 400 25
expect calc == 300
cheat calc_reduce 400 100
expect calc == 0
cheat calc_reduce 400 150
expect calc == 0
